  textPrefab: {fileID: 5156789911168502929, guid: d20b731b126382b448282bb06a3f04f8, type: 3}
  container: {fileID: 1035837384}
  description: "Kho\xE1 h\u1ECDc \u0110\u1EA1i \u0110\u1EA1o Ch\xED Gi\u1EA3n - Phong
    Th\u1EE7y C\u1ED5 H\u1ECDc I mang \u0111\u1EBFn cho b\u1EA1n m\u1ED9t c\u01A1
    h\u1ED9i hi\u1EBFm c\xF3 \u0111\u1EC3 t\xECm hi\u1EC3u v\xE0 th\u1EF1c h\xE0nh
    ngh\u1EC7 thu\u1EADt phong th\u1EE7y, m\u1ED9t l\u0129nh v\u1EF1c \u0111a chi\u1EC1u
    v\xE0 s\xE2u s\u1EAFc trong n\u1EC1n v\u0103n h\xF3a \xC1 \u0110\xF4ng. D\u01B0\u1EDBi
    s\u1EF1 h\u01B0\u1EDBng d\u1EABn c\u1EE7a Phong Th\u1EE7y S\u01B0. Th\u1EA1c
    s\u0129 Nguy\u1EC5n Tr\u1ECDng M\u1EA1nh, m\u1ED9t trong nh\u1EEFng chuy\xEAn
    gia h\xE0ng \u0111\u1EA7u trong l\u0129nh v\u1EF1c n\xE0y, b\u1EA1n s\u1EBD kh\xE1m
    ph\xE1 ra nh\u1EEFng b\xED quy\u1EBFt v\xE0 k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt \u0111\u1EC3 \xE1p
    d\u1EE5ng Phong th\u1EE7y v\xE0o cu\u1ED9c s\u1ED1ng h\xE0ng ng\xE0y c\u1EE7a
    m\xECnh."
  time: 5
